From: GEEKiDoS <geek_ds@foxmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Input: aw86927 - support AW86937 board RAM waveforms

Adapt AW86937 support from h0cheung-tb322fc-linux-kernel (b0c05eb72e10).
Keep the existing AW86927 and AW86938 hardware initialization and playback
sequences unchanged. Select the new boost and stop controls only on
AW86937.

Load board RAM waveforms with checksum, bounds and SRAM readback validation.
The Lenovo Y700 Gen4 uses two independent AW86937 controllers and selects
its stock sustained-vibration waveform in devicetree. Drain pending effects
on close, suspend and shutdown, and hold reset when releasing the device.

